---
source: libs/extractor/src/native/tests.rs
expression: "compile_for(NativePlatform::Ios, runtime, &code)"
---
error: test.tsx:2:6: `<Box>` cannot use `p` on React Native: a responsive value is chosen by the window width, which needs the React Native runtime that `runtime: false` turns off. Fix: give one value
test.tsx:2:17: `<Box>` cannot use `_themeDark` on React Native: devup.json defines no `dark` theme. Fix: add the theme to devup.json, or remove the block
test.tsx:2:33: `<Box>` cannot use `_pressed` on React Native: a press style is chosen while the element is pressed, which needs the React Native runtime that `runtime: false` turns off. Fix: pass a function to the `style` of a React Native `Pressable`, reading `pressed`
